        <activityName xml:lang="en">Granite, natural stone council, milled, loose, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Granite, natural stone council, milled, loose, at plant
This dataset reflects granite milling and is based on the ecoinvent dataset "limestone, milled, loose, at plant" and scaled based on the ratio of energy consumption for granite and limestone processing reported by the natural stone council.;
UUID: 6db7a9b5-cb6a-3e0c-bb0d-0d6b81a400a4
This dataset includes the material and energy use of milling 1 kg of granite in Switzerland.
Location: Data from North America modelled with Swiss and European datasets.
Technology: Typical technology for average Swiss production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6db7a9b5-cb6a-3e0c-bb0d-0d6b81a400a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
